# ==============================================================================
# CodeMyPicture — Environment Configuration Reference
# ==============================================================================
#
# Core Synthesis Architecture:
# - All image processing and ML inference (MediaPipe) execute 100% locally in browser RAM.
# - No backend API keys or database connections are needed for core vector reconstruction.
#
# Optional Integrations:
# The following environment variables configure optional Google Analytics 4
# and the serverless contact email dispatch function.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Product Analytics (Google Analytics 4)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional GA4 Measurement ID (format: G-XXXXXXXXXX).
# If unset, analytics runs in silent standby mode (zero tracking calls dispatched).
# When set, analytics respects user consent (default: denied).
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Serverless Contact Form & Email Notifications (Netlify Function)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Receiver email inbox where visitor contact inquiries will be delivered.
# Pre-configured default: mandoreparth14@gmail.com (override via Netlify env vars)
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=mandoreparth14@gmail.com

# Transactional email service API key (Resend: https://resend.com):
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_1234567890abcdef

# Verified sender address configured in your transactional email provider:
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=CodeMyPicture Notifications <notifications@codemypicture.app>

# Send receipt acknowledgement email back to visitor ('true' or 'false'):
# CONTACT_SEND_ACK=false
